{"parse":{"title":"特性/蛮熊战魂2","pageid":7309,"revid":17437,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E6%88%98%E9%AD%822&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E6%88%98%E9%AD%822&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E6%88%98%E9%AD%822&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>蛮熊战魂2</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.9B.AE.E7.86.8A.E6.88.98.E9.AD.822\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蛮熊战魂2\"><b>蛮熊战魂2</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 蛮熊战魂.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/00/4le6cate3e8me7t348vx16owwur14gd.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E6%88%98%E9%AD%82.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/00/4le6cate3e8me7t348vx16owwur14gd.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E6%88%98%E9%AD%82.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/00/4le6cate3e8me7t348vx16owwur14gd.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />蛮熊战魂2\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦受到环境伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>，受到百分比伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强韧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强韧</font></span></span>]与[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破盾4\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">破盾4</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动开始时，若自身处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受伤</font></span></span>]状态，则进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"兽化\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">兽化</font></span></span>]。<br />✦被击败时，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无限不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无限不屈</font></span></span>]，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">怒血</span>]，效果：受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×受治疗</font></span></span>]，攻击无视目标防御，攻击时无视目标<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>防御值。效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，之后消亡。<br />✦失去[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]后，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无限不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无限不屈</font></span></span>]最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦生命值越低，攻击越高，最高在生命值接近<font color=\"#ed7950\">0</font>时，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>；<br />✦生命值低于<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>时，移动力减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦受到最终伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E5%8B%87%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/蛮熊勇士\"><img alt=\"蛮熊勇士 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/96/hg9z85uyzk0zz2uwacoj3qf2sbkqgmc.png/75px-%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E5%8B%87%E5%A3%AB_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/96/hg9z85uyzk0zz2uwacoj3qf2sbkqgmc.png/113px-%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E5%8B%87%E5%A3%AB_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/96/hg9z85uyzk0zz2uwacoj3qf2sbkqgmc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164201\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.187 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1087/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19812/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5198/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,templat